 "notes": [
  "Qty 59 as published (with the second Tempest 1): 'Characters [ISB] (13)' lists 12 cards. 'Ver. 1.0' is a version header, not a card.",
  "The list posts 'Tempest 1' once under 'Vehicles (2)'; the strategy says 'There should be 2 Tempest 1's just forgot the x2', so it is x2.",
  "'Starting (6)': the Objective, 'Courscant Downtown Plaza', Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order and Oppressive Enforcement. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "'Courscant Downtown Plaza' (started 'for my Objective requirements', i.e. ISB Operations' 'Deploy any Coruscant location') matches no card: Downtown Plaza is a Cloud City site and no Coruscant site of that name existed. Left UNKNOWN as posted.",
  "Posted 'Walakimmi' dested Wakeelmui; 'Y4 Docking Bay' Yavin 4: Docking Bay; 'Endor Landing Platform' Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'Tattooine Docking Bay 94' Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Colonel Wullf Yuaren' Colonel Wullf Yularen; 'M'ilyoom Onith' M'iiyoom Onith; 'Boba Fett Blaster Rifle' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Mara's Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Darth Vader' the Premiere Darth Vader. Oppressive Enforcement is an Effect in 2000 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shield)."
